<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Montevideo Reach, 1973</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;In 1973,&amp;nbsp;a coup in Uruguay placed a military junta in control of the country.&amp;nbsp; In history, the&amp;nbsp;junta crushed all opposition; trade&amp;nbsp;unions and political parties were illegal for a decade following the coup.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that leftists were more successful in resisting the government crackdown, eventually triggering a general rebellion.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;It also assumes the Sovet Union has decided to support the rebels in the hopes of eventually establishing another socialist state in Latin America.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
